{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/ab5f56bcf43bb232d2a871c906529333.poster.avif?t=1772713632\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/ab5f56bcf43bb232d2a871c906529333.webm?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/ab5f56bcf43bb232d2a871c906529333.mp4?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is a rarity in close-quarter arenas riddled with traps for intense firefights. Players must decide where and when to fire at the risk of exposing their position. Hone your senses with the room-scanning Echo mechanic to help you navigate the arena and locate your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/c55887c92e5ec76c54b72897bd994fad.poster.avif?t=1772713632\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/c55887c92e5ec76c54b72897bd994fad.webm?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/c55887c92e5ec76c54b72897bd994fad.mp4?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the arena alone or team up in matches of up to 8 players. In Bodycount mode, score the most points over five rapid-fire rounds. Be the last person standing when the lights come on and earn your place in the winner's showcase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/8d8c5ad7b1eb6f5451a3afead608fa54.poster.avif?t=1772713632\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/8d8c5ad7b1eb6f5451a3afead608fa54.webm?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/8d8c5ad7b1eb6f5451a3afead608fa54.mp4?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When defeated, spectators gain access to the arena's cutting-edge night vision cameras. Blacklight reveals the vibrant hues of hidden street art and transforms the slick designs of contestants' outfits. The eliminated spectators can assume control of traps in the arena to influence the outcome of the match and exact revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/283b45a5add42ef692ed671c74eecf56.poster.avif?t=1772713632\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/283b45a5add42ef692ed671c74eecf56.webm?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/283b45a5add42ef692ed671c74eecf56.mp4?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pitch-black battlefields of Blindfire turn the first-person shooter genre on its head. Stalk the shadows as the tension builds, then run for cover as the shots start flying in a volley of muzzle flashes. Think you've got what it takes to eliminate the competition in Blindfire? Then grab your weapon and <strong>LIGHT THEM UP</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"This Round Is On Me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2854480/e9518b270fe4c72f3fe1d2eb8bd47e855e28ebe4.jpg"},{"name":"A Friend In Need","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2854480/cde316b9beee20c5e9ad9a4e8adc11834dc8f513.jpg"},{"name":"P4P, Headshot, Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2854480/4cf38ff34405b8e90abdfe333c0b3ca1b840832d.jpg"},{"name":"The First Avenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2854480/72e4d35a712f1b695921cc0ed7317312ed213f6f.jpg"},{"name":"Diamond Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2854480/4a3b554a7cfc36bc11e89ce5f9e77cbcb6600709.jpg"},{"name":"Tick Tock, There Goes The Clock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2854480/e6d8365a75a6966d205ad809de98c72a25b60ea3.jpg"},{"name":"Goose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2854480/96c1d2d9e709a3bb56fa3e969847117d9430d347.jpg"},{"name":"Fists Of Fury","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2854480/298772ce33e76bcd90f7a9d2b5f1fc748b2e17f8.jpg"},{"name":"9MM Menace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2854480/3ea797d8d81f3d9f4916ebcb26216e91c64b98ab.jpg"},{"name":"Webslinger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2854480/d679bcf5f04c023054c8047fc3dca6d03384bb6c.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2854480?t=1772713632","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772713632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/fa29f53e5302c52992ee23018995b559edec29eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772713632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/fa29f53e5302c52992ee23018995b559edec29eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772713632","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/ab5f56bcf43bb232d2a871c906529333.poster.avif?t=1772713632\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/ab5f56bcf43bb232d2a871c906529333.webm?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/ab5f56bcf43bb232d2a871c906529333.mp4?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is a rarity in close-quarter arenas riddled with traps for intense firefights. Players must decide where and when to fire at the risk of exposing their position. Hone your senses with the room-scanning Echo mechanic to help you navigate the arena and locate your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/c55887c92e5ec76c54b72897bd994fad.poster.avif?t=1772713632\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/c55887c92e5ec76c54b72897bd994fad.webm?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/c55887c92e5ec76c54b72897bd994fad.mp4?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the arena alone or team up in matches of up to 8 players. In Bodycount mode, score the most points over five rapid-fire rounds. Be the last person standing when the lights come on and earn your place in the winner's showcase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/8d8c5ad7b1eb6f5451a3afead608fa54.poster.avif?t=1772713632\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/8d8c5ad7b1eb6f5451a3afead608fa54.webm?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/8d8c5ad7b1eb6f5451a3afead608fa54.mp4?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When defeated, spectators gain access to the arena's cutting-edge night vision cameras. Blacklight reveals the vibrant hues of hidden street art and transforms the slick designs of contestants' outfits. The eliminated spectators can assume control of traps in the arena to influence the outcome of the match and exact revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/283b45a5add42ef692ed671c74eecf56.poster.avif?t=1772713632\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/283b45a5add42ef692ed671c74eecf56.webm?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/extras/283b45a5add42ef692ed671c74eecf56.mp4?t=1772713632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pitch-black battlefields of Blindfire turn the first-person shooter genre on its head. Stalk the shadows as the tension builds, then run for cover as the shots start flying in a volley of muzzle flashes. Think you've got what it takes to eliminate the competition in Blindfire? Then grab your weapon and <strong>LIGHT THEM UP</strong>.</p>","developers":["Double Eleven"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Epic Online Services (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854480/header.jpg?t=1772713632","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Double Eleven Ltd.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2854480/786691/1acd711bdb2c0a01f3d80bba6eb3a6ebc39de29d/1750947858/dash_av1.mpd?t=1732199900","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2854480/786691/1acd711bdb2c0a01f3d80bba6eb3a6ebc39de29d/17509478